# Dataset

The dataset used in this project was provided during my Data Science Internship and contains proprietary business information.

To respect confidentiality and data privacy agreements, the original dataset has not been included in this public repository.

This repository focuses on demonstrating the complete machine learning workflow, including:

- Data preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Feature Engineering
- Model Development
- Model Evaluation
- MLflow Experiment Tracking
- Streamlit Deployment

